BIB                  9         24
TITLE      Mechanisms of proton and alpha particle emission in
            the natCu reaction at 22 MeV
AUTHOR     (G.A.Ussabayeva, T.K.Zholdybayev, Zh.T.Mukan,
            B.M.Sadykov, A.A.Temirzhanov, Y.Kucuk, I.Boztosun,
