            University, Almaty; Satbayev University, Almaty
           (2TUKTUK) Akdeniz University, Antalya; Turkish
            Acceleration and Radiation Center (TARLA), Ankara
           (4KASKAS) International University of Engineering and
            Technology, Almaty
REFERENCE  (J,INTR,247,69,2026)
SAMPLE     A self-supporting natural copper foil (3.5 mg/cm2)
METHOD     (EDE,BCINT)
FACILITY   (ISOCY,4KASKAZ) U-150M
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-T) Total uncertainty
           (ERR-SYS,,10.) Total systematic uncertainty  (<10%)
           (ERR-1,,5.)     Target thickness               (<5%)
           (ERR-2)        Current integrator calibration  (1%)
           (ERR-3)        Solid angle of spectrometer   (1.3%)
           (ERR-4)        Beam energy determination       (1%)
HISTORY    (20260916C) TZ
ENDBIB              24
COMMON               4          3
EN         ERR-2      ERR-3      ERR-4
MEV        PER-CENT   PER-CENT   PER-CENT
 22.        1.         1.3        1.
ENDCOMMON            3
